    "faq.plist-support.details" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نعم! يدعم HelpView كلاً من صيغتي **JSON** و **plist**.\n\n**هيكل Plist:**\n```xml\n<dict>\n  <key>topics</key>\n  <array>\n    <string>البدء</string>\n  </array>\n  <key>faqs</key>\n  <array>\n    <dict>\n      <key>title</key>\n      <string>سؤالك</string>\n      <key>details</key>\n      <string>إجابتك</string>\n      <key>topic</key>\n      <string>البدء</string>\n    </dict>\n  </array>\n</dict>\n```\n\n**اكتشاف الصيغة:**\nيحاول المحمّل `.json` أولاً، ثم `.plist` تلقائياً. فقط استخدم اسم الملف بدون الامتداد."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yes! HelpView supports both **JSON** and **plist** formats.\n\n**Plist Structure:**\n```xml\n<dict>\n  <key>topics</key>\n  <array>\n    <string>Getting Started</string>\n  </array>\n  <key>faqs</key>\n  <array>\n    <dict>\n      <key>title</key>\n      <string>Your question</string>\n      <key>details</key>\n      <string>Your answer</string>\n      <key>topic</key>\n      <string>Getting Started</string>\n    </dict>\n  </array>\n</dict>\n```\n\n**Format Detection:**\nThe loader tries `.json` first, then `.plist` automatically. Just use the filename without extension."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oui ! HelpView supporte les formats **JSON** et **plist**.\n\n**Structure Plist :**\n```xml\n<dict>\n  <key>topics</key>\n  <array>\n    <string>Premiers pas</string>\n  </array>\n  <key>faqs</key>\n  <array>\n    <dict>\n      <key>title</key>\n      <string>Votre question</string>\n      <key>details</key>\n      <string>Votre réponse</string>\n      <key>topic</key>\n      <string>Premiers pas</string>\n    </dict>\n  </array>\n</dict>\n```\n\n**Détection du format :**\nLe chargeur essaie `.json` d'abord, puis `.plist` automatiquement. Utilisez simplement le nom de fichier sans extension."
          }
        }
      }
    },
